1
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,878
Where did Earth go?

2
00:00:04,647 --> 00:00:08,873
I don't know.
He just grabbed his stuff and ran off.

3
00:00:11,179 --> 00:00:14,298
Didn't you say he was sick?
Then where'd he go?

4
00:00:16,297 --> 00:00:21,160
No idea. Probably went somewhere.

5
00:00:21,852 --> 00:00:23,034
Where?

6
00:00:23,726 --> 00:00:25,499
I really don't know.

7
00:00:26,039 --> 00:00:30,077
Why don't you guys go talk to
each other yourselves?

8
00:00:53,359 --> 00:00:57,199
He's not answering.
I called him so many times.

9
00:00:57,199 --> 00:01:02,357
He just grabbed his bag and ran out earlier.

10
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:04,918
I'm telling the truth, I'm not lying.

11
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,512
When he heard your name,
he grabbed his stuff—

12
00:01:09,512 --> 00:01:11,213
—and rushed out.

13
00:01:12,212 --> 00:01:14,651
Do you guys have some problem?

14
00:01:14,651 --> 00:01:20,373
Last night he stopped you from
getting into a fight at the club.

15
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:33,240
No… nothing.
I was just really drunk last night.

16
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:36,692
And your friend— is he okay?

17
00:01:37,576 --> 00:01:40,283
Is he hurt somewhere?

18
00:01:42,647 --> 00:01:45,911
Nah, he just has a fever.

19
00:01:46,776 --> 00:01:49,350
He seems tired too.

20
00:01:49,734 --> 00:01:54,553
But what's weird is he suddenly said
he'd find a new place to live.

21
00:01:54,957 --> 00:02:01,947
That's why I asked if you
did something last night.

22
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:06,390
Were you drunk and kicked him out?

23
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,298
I… I don't know. But—

24
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:29,057
No, no—
If you can reach him, tell him—

25
00:02:29,057 --> 00:02:32,777
—I'm worried about him.

26
00:02:32,777 --> 00:02:34,231
Alright.
